], "createTime": 1790184083, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-6-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}}]}, {"range": "33389-33454", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "394312996_895sA8gg0", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "中周期（朱格拉周期）的繁荣，是指企业基于对经济前景的乐观预期，大规模更新设备、扩建产能，从而带动整个产业链扩张。中周期繁荣的“核心驱动力”——企业自发的、基于盈利的、全面的产能扩张。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "中周期繁荣", "range": "33396-33401", "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "394312996_895sA8gg0", "userVid": 394312996, "topics": [], "createTime": 1778725563, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 394312996, "name": "我是Zn", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/AHEla05LlXJL9uaqf2B4mehOyYRykNMXNich68mFGzHsfh283yqOn6EmfmwtnHIz4hLgicF3V62vibFmuJtpJRoasBw9dEic0ibpnfb1gBUicxuDg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-1-0-H-0-0-0", "desc": "微信读书·学生勋章", "title": "学生认证", "levelIndex": 1}}}, "likesCount": 4}, {"reviewId": "235678482_8dc515VoR", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "中周期繁荣的真正驱动力，不是靠短期政策刺激，而是靠新的增长点（新兴产业）的固定资产投资。但市场对新兴产业的追捧，本质上是在押注“经济结构要变了”，而不是押注“经济周期要涨了”。这两者不能混为一谈——周期繁荣是短期的、全面的；结构转型是长期的、局部的。如果你把结构转型误当成周期繁荣，就会高估传统行业的复苏，低估新兴产业的长期潜力。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "如果理论上确认中周期繁荣是存在的，那么其核心驱动力也就是所谓新的增长点在哪里？这正是我们上面为何从固定资产投资的视角来寻找新起点。", "range": "33389-33454", "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "235678482_8dc515VoR", "userVid": 235678482, "topics": [], "createTime": 1793188034, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 235678482, "name": "黄三", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/gvBLGc61ianZ8Rp5pBUc1gthoDCJj0q1xDtfMsybZODPa8IYueW1aoNFek0KPXGYibicEFge6icRkUa0AVn9QBKm8Fj5X6fMJk5ibFLHCI2Is2GI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 1}]}, {"range": "33599-33687", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 4, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "223635575_8cldXi6mI", "review": {"abstract": "这与固定资产投资的逻辑相结合", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 11, "content": "在国内无法实现对独立的新技术和组织创新直接投资，都去了美国资本市场，只好退而求其次了。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "33642-33656", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "223635575_8cldXi6mI", "userVid": 223635575, "topics": [], "createTime": 1790185810, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-6-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "426066534_8d2W4e5OI", "review": {"abstract": "所以，某些技术扩散或组织创新和模式创新可以通过拉动传统产业的改造而带来中周期繁荣。如果这与固定资产投资的逻辑相结合，对未来增长点的寻找就要集中于更切实际的传统产业升级和消费升级", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "关于ai产业，它也不是就是现在才出来的新东西，那个口语听力教材里老师2020年就说Ai发展很快，会取代很多人的工作。而到今天，连我爸都知道Ai很厉害了。。。\n在落地上面，我总觉得现在可能陷入一个误区，ai大模型其实可以理解，比如码农写代码，工作已经带来了很大的便利，这已经算提升生产效率了吧，这个发展方向是正常的。但是人形机器人这块，为什么总在展示它多酷多炫。。。即使特斯拉那个飞车，，我想问这种功能除了装个b在现实中还有其他作用吗？而机器人更好的应用不应该是结合Ai大脑让它在工业场景，商业场景，家庭场景处理一些实质工作内容吗？搞什么翻跟斗，机甲战士，我真的很难懂", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "html